.TH GH-ACTIONS-STORAGE 1 "November 2026" "arran4 dotfiles" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gh-actions-storage \- audit retained GitHub Actions artifacts and repository retention
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gh-actions-storage
.RB [ --owner " " LOGIN ]
.RB [ --include-public ]
.RB [ --set-retention-1d ]
.RB [ --delete-old-artifacts ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Audits non-archived private repositories owned by arran4 by default.
Shows current artifact sizes and repository-level workflow run, log, check,
and artifact retention. Read-only unless an explicit write flag is provided.
Current bytes are not the same as accrued monthly gigabyte-hours.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --owner " LOGIN"
Select an account owner other than arran4.
.TP
.B --include-public
Include public repositories.
.TP
.B --set-retention-1d
Set retention for NEW workflow runs, checks, artifacts and logs to one day.
Requires repository Administration write permission.
It cannot retroactively shorten existing artifacts.
.TP
.B --delete-old-artifacts
Permanently delete existing Actions artifacts created over 24 hours ago.
Requires Actions write permission; may remove files needed for manual review
or unfinished release workflows. Does not remove workflow logs, caches,
GitHub Releases or Packages, or reverse already-accrued billing.
.TP
.BR -h ", " --help
Print help.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
gh-actions-storage
gh-actions-storage --set-retention-1d
gh-actions-storage --delete-old-artifacts
.fi
.SH PREREQUISITES
Requires authenticated
.BR gh (1),
GNU
.BR date (1),
and
.BR awk (1).
No credentials are stored in dotfiles.
.SH SAFETY
Run the read-only audit and check release needs before deleting artifacts.
Retention and deletion operations are always explicitly opted into.
